  "notes": "弱网恢复更顺畅。\n\n- 安全 DNS 会并行尝试备用服务，单个解析服务或地址类型无响应时，也能及时使用已返回的可用地址。\n- 面板镜像失效时，自动从当前可信名单中重新选择可达镜像。\n- 服务状态更准确地区分直连入口受限、地区离线和状态未知。直连 TCP 受限不代表 Hysteria 2 或中转连接也不可用。\n",
  "notesEn": "Smoother recovery on unreliable networks.\n\n- Secure DNS tries backup services in parallel, so an unresponsive resolver or address family does not hold up an available answer.\n- If a panel mirror becomes unreachable, YueLink can select another reachable mirror from the current trusted list.\n- Service status now distinguishes restricted direct paths, offline regions, and unknown observations. A restricted direct TCP path does not mean Hysteria 2 or relay connections are also unavailable.\n",
